    "causal_summary": "The review found ten classes of documentation that the tree contradicts: nine catalog references citing absent paths, a superseded runtime generation cited in three catalogs, a contract count wrong in two READMEs, a playbook asserting no test suite exists against 121 unit test files, removed benchmark artifacts still advertised as live, five test files named under a prefix they no longer carry, a catalog claiming fifty-five entries against fifty-four, a repository-wide checker presented as a local acceptance test, a retired command path with a dead anchor, and two READMEs pointing one",
